{"line":66,"column":1,"offset":1632},"end":{"line":66,"column":6,"offset":1637}}},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"take challenge","position":{"start":{"line":66,"column":6,"offset":1637},"end":{"line":66,"column":22,"offset":1653}}},{"type":"text","value":" 按鈕，然後將檔案拖放到那裡！","position":{"start":{"line":66,"column":22,"offset":1653},"end":{"line":66,"column":37,"offset":1668}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":66,"column":1,"offset":1632},"end":{"line":66,"column":37,"offset":1668}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1,"offset":0},"end":{"line":67,"column":1,"offset":1670}}},"raw":"import { ArticleSection } from \"../../../../../components/ArticleSection/ArticleSection\";\r\n\r\n<ArticleSection name=\"退款\" id=\"refund\" level=\"h2\" />\r\n\r\n我們現在可以進入 `refund` 指令，該指令位於 `refund.rs`，並將執行以下操作：\r\n- 關閉托管 PDA，並將其租金 lamports 退還給創建者。\r\n- 將保管庫中的全部 Token A 餘額移回創建者，然後關閉保管庫帳戶。\r\n\r\n### 帳戶 \r\n\r\n在此情境中需要的帳戶包括：\r\n- `maker`：決定交換條款的用戶\r\n- `escrow`：存放所有交換條款的帳戶\r\n- `mint_a`：`maker` 已存入的代幣\r\n- `vault`：與 `escrow` 和 `mint_a` 關聯的代幣帳戶，存放了代幣\r\n- `maker_ata_a`：與 `maker` 和 `mint_a` 關聯的代幣帳戶，將從 `vault` 接收代幣\r\n- `associated_token_program`：用於創建關聯代幣帳戶的關聯代幣程序\r\n- `token_program`：用於 CPI 轉移的代幣程序\r\n- `system_program`：用於創建 `Escrow` 的系統程序\r\n\r\n這次我們不會幫助你創建 `Context`，所以請嘗試自己完成！請確保使用正確的帳戶順序，否則我們的測試將失敗。\r\n\r\n### 邏輯 \r\n\r\n邏輯與 `take` 指令類似，但這次我們只是將代幣從 `vault` 移動到 `maker_ata_a`，然後關閉現在已空的保管庫。\r\n\r\n這次輪到你自己學習如何完成，所以我們不會告訴你解決方案是什麼。\r\n\r\n請注意，一旦執行此操作，該提議將失效，保管庫將被移除，並且創建者的 Token A 和租金將返回到他們的錢包中。\r\n\r\n<ArticleSection name=\"Entrypoint\" id=\"entrypoint\" level=\"h2\" />\r\n\r\n現在我們已經在不同的指令中創建了所有的函數，終於可以將我們創建的所有函數填充到 `lib.rs` 中；像這樣：\r\n\r\n```rust\r\n#[program]\r\npub mod Kiloshift_anchor_escrow {\r\n    use super::*;\r\n\r\n    pub fn make(ctx: Context<Make>, seed: u64, receive: u64, amount: u64) -> Result<()> {\r\n        instructions::make::handler(ctx, seed, receive, amount)\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    pub fn take(ctx: Context<Take>) -> Result<()> {\r\n        instructions::take::handler(ctx)\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    pub fn refund(ctx: Context<Refund>) -> Result<()> {\r\n        instructions::refund::handler(ctx)\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n<ArticleSection name=\"Conclusion\" id=\"conclusion\" level=\"h2\" />\r\n\r\n現在你可以使用我們的單元測試來測試你的程式並領取你的 NFT！\r\n\r\n首先在終端中使用以下指令構建你的程式\r\n\r\n```bash\r\nanchor build\r\n```\r\n\r\n這會直接在你的 `target/deploy` 資料夾中生成一個 `.so` 檔案。\r\n\r\n現在點擊 `take challenge` 按鈕，然後將檔案拖放到那裡！\r\n","highlightedCode":{"code-0":{"lang":"rust","hast":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"pre","properties":{"class":"shiki Kiloshift","style":"background-color:#11141a;color:#f6f6f4","tabindex":"0"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"code","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"class":"line"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F6F6F4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"#[program]"}]}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"class":"line"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F286C4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"pub"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F286C4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":" mod"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#97E1F1;font-style:italic"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":" Kiloshift_anchor_escrow"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F6F6F4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":" {"}]}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"class":"line"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F286C4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"    use"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#BF9EEE;font-style:italic"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":" super"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F286C4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":